    {
      "id": "eOm9e1m8DcVfBlnCaq6vl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800.6028453092908,
      "y": -672.6597514951067,
      "width": 108.4949800289812,
      "height": 108.49498002898116,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fefffe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2112226291,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 1032016435,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760443612953,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blog Object\nAttributes\ntitle: A string representing the name of the\nblog.\nauthor: A string indicating the creator or\nowner of the blog.\nposts: An array or list of post objects\nassociated with the blog.\ncreationDate: A date object showing when the\nblog was created.\ncategory: A string specifying the topic or\ngenre of the blog.\nMethods\naddPost(post): Adds a new post to the blog's\nposts list.\ngetPosts(): Returns the list of all posts in\nthe blog.\npublish(): Marks the blog as published and\nmakes it visible.\ndeletePost(postId): Removes a specific post\nfrom the blog based on its ID.",
      "fontSize": 4.133142096342139,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Blog Object\nAttributes\ntitle: A string representing the name of the blog.\nauthor: A string indicating the creator or owner of the blog.\nposts: An array or list of post objects associated with the blog.\ncreationDate: A date object showing when the blog was created.\ncategory: A string specifying the topic or genre of the blog.\nMethods\naddPost(post): Adds a new post to the blog's posts list.\ngetPosts(): Returns the list of all posts in the blog.\npublish(): Marks the blog as published and makes it visible.\ndeletePost(postId): Removes a specific post from the blog based on its ID.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_QgiZsbURXVE8bcONce2y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 921.3440553105642,
      "y": -667.795520801272,
      "width": 91.30434782608701,
      "height": 100.00000000000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fefffe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1SG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1314878749,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 167828787,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760443632969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blog Object Design\nAttributes:\ntitle: A string representing the title of the\nblog post.\nauthor: A string representing the name of the\nauthor.\ncontent: A string containing the main body of\nthe blog post.\ntags: An array of strings representing the tags\nor categories associated with the blog post.\npublishedDate: A date object representing when\nthe blog post was published.\nMethods:\npublish(): Marks the blog post as published and\nsets the publishedDate to the current date.\neditContent(newContent): Updates the content\nattribute with the provided newContent.\naddTag(tag): Adds a new tag to the tags array.\nremoveTag(tag): Removes a specific tag from the\ntags array if it exists.\ngetSummary(): Returns a short summary of the\nblog post, such as the first 100 characters of\nthe content.",
      "fontSize": 3.4782608695652195,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Blog Object Design\nAttributes:\ntitle: A string representing the title of the blog post.\nauthor: A string representing the name of the author.\ncontent: A string containing the main body of the blog post.\ntags: An array of strings representing the tags or categories associated with the blog post.\npublishedDate: A date object representing when the blog post was published.\nMethods:\npublish(): Marks the blog post as published and sets the publishedDate to the current date.\neditContent(newContent): Updates the content attribute with the provided newContent.\naddTag(tag): Adds a new tag to the tags array.\nremoveTag(tag): Removes a specific tag from the tags array if it exists.\ngetSummary(): Returns a short summary of the blog post, such as the first 100 characters of the content.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RCqALBPw2STwLDQ7OS8ft",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 140.00000000000003,
      "height": 273.33333333333326,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fefffe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1SV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 647332029,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 1922253587,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760445626140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blog Management System\nOverview\nThis system consists of 4 related objects: Blog, Post,\nComment, and User. They model a simple blogging\nplatform where users create blogs, write posts, and\nengage with comments.\n\nObjects\n\nBlog\nAttributes: title (string), author (User object), posts (array\nof Post objects), creationDate (date).\nMethods: addPost(post), getPosts(), publish().\n\nPost\nAttributes: title (string), content (string), author (User\nobject), comments (array of Comment objects),\npublishDate (date).\nMethods: addComment(comment), getComments(),\neditContent(newContent).\n\nComment\nAttributes: content (string), author (User object), post\n(Post object), timestamp (date).\nMethods: editContent(newContent), delete().\n\nUser\nAttributes: username (string), email (string), blogs (array\nof Blog objects), posts (array of Post objects).\nMethods: createBlog(title), createPost(blog, title, content),\naddComment(post, content).\n\nInteractions\nA User can create a Blog, which adds the Blog to the\nUser's blogs list.\nA User can create a Post within a Blog, linking the Post to\nthe Blog and User.\nA User can add a Comment to a Post, associating the\nComment with the Post and User.\nPosts belong to a Blog and can have multiple Comments.\nComments are tied to a specific Post and its author.",
      "fontSize": 5.333333333333332,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Blog Management System\nOverview\nThis system consists of 4 related objects: Blog, Post, Comment, and User. They model a simple blogging platform where users create blogs, write posts, and engage with comments.\n\nObjects\n\nBlog\nAttributes: title (string), author (User object), posts (array of Post objects), creationDate (date).\nMethods: addPost(post), getPosts(), publish().\n\nPost\nAttributes: title (string), content (string), author (User object), comments (array of Comment objects), publishDate (date).\nMethods: addComment(comment), getComments(), editContent(newContent).\n\nComment\nAttributes: content (string), author (User object), post (Post object), timestamp (date).\nMethods: editContent(newContent), delete().\n\nUser\nAttributes: username (string), email (string), blogs (array of Blog objects), posts (array of Post objects).\nMethods: createBlog(title), createPost(blog, title, content), addComment(post, content).\n\nInteractions\nA User can create a Blog, which adds the Blog to the User's blogs list.\nA User can create a Post within a Blog, linking the Post to the Blog and User.\nA User can add a Comment to a Post, associating the Comment with the Post and User.\nPosts belong to a Blog and can have multiple Comments.\nComments are tied to a specific Post and its author.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8UkZf9m3H7h6YLv0gk63s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 40.000000000000014,
      "width": 180.00000000000006,
      "height": 393.33333333333326,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fefffe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Sd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1163632253,
      "version": 367,
      "versionNonce": 1698527987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760445622957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blogging System Design\nObjects:\n\nBlog\nAttributes:\ntitle: The title of the blog post.\nauthor: The author of the blog post.\ncontent: The main body of the blog post.\ntags: A list of tags associated with the blog post.\npublishedDate: The date the blog post was published.\nMethods:\npublish(): Marks the blog post as published and sets the publishedDate.\neditContent(newContent): Updates the blog's content.\naddTag(tag): Adds a tag to the blog post.\nremoveTag(tag): Removes a tag from the blog post.\ngetSummary(): Returns a short summary of the blog post.\n\nAuthor\nAttributes:\nname: The name of the author.\nemail: The email address of the author.\nbio: A short biography of the author.\nblogs: A list of blogs written by the author.\nMethods:\nwriteBlog(title, content, tags): Creates a new blog post and adds it to the\nauthor's list of blogs.\neditBlog(blog, newContent): Edits the content of an existing blog post.\ndeleteBlog(blog): Removes a blog post from the author's list of blogs.\n\nComment\nAttributes:\nauthor: The name of the person who wrote the comment.\ncontent: The content of the comment.\ndate: The date the comment was posted.\nMethods:\neditComment(newContent): Updates the content of the comment.\ndeleteComment(): Deletes the comment.\n\nBlogManager\nAttributes:\nblogs: A list of all blog posts in the system.\ncomments: A list of all comments in the system.\nMethods:\naddBlog(blog): Adds a new blog post to the system.\nremoveBlog(blog): Removes a blog post from the system.\naddComment(blog, comment): Adds a comment to a specific blog post.\ngetBlogsByTag(tag): Returns a list of blogs that contain a specific tag.\ngetBlogsByAuthor(author): Returns a list of blogs written by a specific\nauthor.\n\nInteraction:\nAuthor creates and manages their blog posts using the writeBlog,\neditBlog, and deleteBlog methods.\nBlogManager oversees all blogs and comments in the system, allowing\nblogs to be added, removed, or filtered by tags or authors.\nComment objects are associated with specific Blog objects, and users can\nadd, edit, or delete comments.\nThe Blog object interacts with both Author and Comment, serving as the\ncentral entity in the system.",
      "fontSize": 5.333333333333332,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Blogging System Design\nObjects:\n\nBlog\nAttributes:\ntitle: The title of the blog post.\nauthor: The author of the blog post.\ncontent: The main body of the blog post.\ntags: A list of tags associated with the blog post.\npublishedDate: The date the blog post was published.\nMethods:\npublish(): Marks the blog post as published and sets the publishedDate.\neditContent(newContent): Updates the blog's content.\naddTag(tag): Adds a tag to the blog post.\nremoveTag(tag): Removes a tag from the blog post.\ngetSummary(): Returns a short summary of the blog post.\n\nAuthor\nAttributes:\nname: The name of the author.\nemail: The email address of the author.\nbio: A short biography of the author.\nblogs: A list of blogs written by the author.\nMethods:\nwriteBlog(title, content, tags): Creates a new blog post and adds it to the author's list of blogs.\neditBlog(blog, newContent): Edits the content of an existing blog post.\ndeleteBlog(blog): Removes a blog post from the author's list of blogs.\n\nComment\nAttributes:\nauthor: The name of the person who wrote the comment.\ncontent: The content of the comment.\ndate: The date the comment was posted.\nMethods:\neditComment(newContent): Updates the content of the comment.\ndeleteComment(): Deletes the comment.\n\nBlogManager\nAttributes:\nblogs: A list of all blog posts in the system.\ncomments: A list of all comments in the system.\nMethods:\naddBlog(blog): Adds a new blog post to the system.\nremoveBlog(blog): Removes a blog post from the system.\naddComment(blog, comment): Adds a comment to a specific blog post.\ngetBlogsByTag(tag): Returns a list of blogs that contain a specific tag.\ngetBlogsByAuthor(author): Returns a list of blogs written by a specific author.\n\nInteraction:\nAuthor creates and manages their blog posts using the writeBlog, editBlog, and deleteBlog methods.\nBlogManager oversees all blogs and comments in the system, allowing blogs to be added, removed, or filtered by tags or authors.\nComment objects are associated with specific Blog objects, and users can add, edit, or delete comments.\nThe Blog object interacts with both Author and Comment, serving as the central entity in the system.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
